                                                                               terms:title "Smarthome Property Pattern"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                               cpannotationschema:coversRequirements "What are the properties of a physical object in a smart home?"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                               rdfs:comment """Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK's quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x8; term declared x3;
- header: dcterms:title \"Smarthome Property Pattern\" - the library's name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library's description of the pattern
Each change is listed under \"curated\" in the pattern's metadata.json in OntoBoard's pattern library."""@en .

